30a592e66adf"],

Cell["\<\
The idea is to implement some standard tools for all the ODEs from Sprott.  \
Here are all the functions, parameters and IC.  I made all of them have \
parameters a, b, c, d, and the smoothing parameter m. The order and names may \
not match your choices.    \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999855743934202*^9, 3.999855893891206*^9}, {
  4.000123071232369*^9, 4.0001232343900614`*^9}, {4.0001934737168045`*^9, 
